a group of general requirements common to the ASTM Copper Alloy Casting specifications.  
These requirements might include pressure tests, certification, or witness.  
Additionally, some of the specific copper alloy casting specifications have 
optional requirements which should be added if they are determined necessary.  
These optional requirements can include, but are not limited to, soundness, 
mechanical properties, and chemical analysis of residual elements.</NPR><BRK/>
