<SPT><TTL>Bolts, Nuts, and Washers</TTL><BRK/>
<BRK/>
<TXT>Provide bolts, nuts, and washers of the material, grade, type, class, style and finish indicated or best suited 
for intended use.</TXT><BRK/>
<BRK/>
<SPT><TTL>High-Strength Bolts, Nuts, and Washers</TTL><BRK/>
<OLG><BRK/>
<OLI><RID>ASTM F3125/F3125M</RID> Grade [A325][A490], [hot-dip galvanized].</OLI><BRK/>
<BRK/>
<OLI>Conduct Rotational-capacity testing for all fastener assemblies in accordance with <RID>ASTM F3125/F3125M</RID>.  
Test as an assembly each combination of bolt production lot, nut lot, and washer lot.  Assign a rotational-capacity 
lot number to each combination of lots tested.  Test bolts in a Skidmore-Wilhelm Calibrator or an acceptable 
equivalent device.  Submit test report for <SUB>rotational capacity</SUB>.</OLI><BRK/></OLG>
<BRK/></SPT>
<SPT><TTL>Bolts, Nuts, and Washers (Other Than High-Strength)</TTL><BRK/>
<OLG><BRK/>
