[_____]] [Austenitic Steel, Class [_____]].</OLI><BRK/>
<BRK/>
<OLI>Bolts - <RID>ASME B18.2.1</RID>.</OLI><BRK/>
<BRK/>
<OLI>Nuts - <RID>ASME B18.2.2</RID>.</OLI><BRK/>
<BRK/>
