<NTE><BRK/>
<AST/><BRK/>
<NPR>NOTE:  For most jobs, ASTM F1554<MET> 248 MPa</MET><ENG> 36 ksi</ENG> anchor bolts are used.  If high 
tensile loads are anticipated, consider the use of<MET> 379 MPa or 724 MPa</MET><ENG> 55 ksi 
or 105 ksi</ENG> ASTM F1554 anchor bolts.  If stainless steel is considered, select 
from material in ASTM A193/A193M.</NPR><BRK/>
